sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant Runner
  participant Scheduler
  participant Task1
  participant Task2
  participant Task3
  participant Task4
  participant Task5
  participant Callback

  Note over Client,Runner: Phase 1 - enqueue 5 tasks
  Client->>Runner: enqueue(Task1)
  Client->>Runner: enqueue(Task2)
  Client->>Runner: enqueue(Task3)
  Client->>Runner: enqueue(Task4)
  Client->>Runner: enqueue(Task5)

  Note over Client,Runner: Phase 2 - start run (sequential)
  Client->>Runner: run(finalCallback)
  Runner->>Runner: invoke next(finalCallback)

  loop for each idle task
    Runner->>Runner: select first idle task
    Runner->>Scheduler: schedule invoke task.run
    Scheduler-->>Task1: invoke scheduled callback
    activate Task1
    Task1->>Task1: set status running
    Task1->>Task1: execute fn
    alt fn synchronous
      Task1-->>Runner: call next (no error)
    else fn asynchronous
      Note right of Task1: fn will call next later
      Task1-->>Runner: call next (later)
    end
    Task1->>Runner: Runner receives task completion
    deactivate Task1
  end

  Note over Runner,Callback: When no idle task remains Runner invokes finalCallback
  Runner->>Callback: finalCallback()
